(§ 260.10 Providing prompt refunds.) Tj T*
(When a refund of a fare or a fee for an ancillary service, including a fee for lost or) Tj T*
(significantly delayed checked baggage, is due pursuant to this part, the refund must be issued) Tj T*
(promptly in the original form of payment \(i.e., money is returned to an individual using) Tj T*
(whatever payment method the individual used to make the original payment, such as a check,) Tj T*
(credit card, debit card, cash, or airline miles\) unless the consumer agrees to receive the) Tj T*
(refunds in a different form of payment that is a cash equivalent as defined in § 260.2. Carriers) Tj T*
(may not retain a processing fee for issuing refunds that are due.) Tj T*
